---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import links from "../data/links.json";
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="section wrap">
    <p class="crumb prompt fade-up" style="--d: 0s">cat about.md</p>
    <h1 class="fade-up" style="--d: 0.06s">About</h1>

    <div class="term fade-up" style="--d: 0.12s">
      <div class="term__bar">
        <span class="term__dot term__dot--r"></span>
        <span class="term__dot term__dot--y"></span>
        <span class="term__dot term__dot--g"></span>
        <span class="term__title">jagan@llm-lab: ~/about</span>
      </div>
      <div class="term__body">
        <p><span class="prompt">whoami</span></p>
        <p class="term__out">
          I'm a software engineer learning how modern large language models are
          built — from Transformer fundamentals to reasoning, Mixture-of-Experts,
          inference, and eventually original research. This site (and its
          <a href={links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">source repo</a>)
          is a public, working lab notebook for that journey.
        </p>
        <p><span class="prompt">echo $CLAIM</span></p>
        <p class="term__out">
          I am <strong>not</strong> claiming to be an AI expert. I am documenting
          the process of becoming one — in the open, with real code, real
          failures, and real results.
        </p>
        <p><span class="prompt">./philosophy --loop</span></p>
        <p class="term__out term__out--accent">learn → implement → experiment → analyze → document → share → repeat<span class="term__caret">▮</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap">
    <h2>Labels, used precisely</h2>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Learning</strong></td><td>Understanding an existing, published concept.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Implementation</strong></td><td>Building an existing, published idea from scratch.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Reproduction</strong></td><td>Attempting to reproduce published findings (usually small-scale).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Experiment</strong></td><td>Modifying or testing an idea under controlled conditions.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Original Research</strong></td><td>Investigating a question beyond simply following a paper.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="muted">
      A small-scale experiment on a consumer GPU is never described as
      reproducing a frontier model — results like that are labeled
      "conceptual small-scale reproduction."
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap">
    <h2>Community</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      Reproductions, corrections, and discussion are welcome. See
      <a href={`${links.github}/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>
      and
      <a href={`${links.github}/blob/master/COMMUNITY.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">COMMUNITY.md</a>
      on GitHub.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .crumb {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }
  .term {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    background: var(--bg-inset);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px var(--glow),
      0 0 48px -10px var(--glow-strong),
      0 24px 48px -24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  .term__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .term__dot {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .term__dot--r { background: #ff5f56; }
  .term__dot--y { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .term__dot--g { background: #27c93f; }
  .term__title {
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .term__body {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .term__body p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .term__body p + p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .term__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .term__out {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .term__out strong {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
  }
  .term__out a {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }
  .term__out--accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .term__caret {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    animation: caret 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes caret {
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .term__body {
      padding: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
  }
</style>
